{"id": 99, "name": "Barats", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/0/0f/Hero991-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021143047", "cls": ["Tank", "Fighter"], "specialty": ["Damage", "Crowd Control"], "difficulty": "40", "stats": ["100", "30", "90", "40"], "lanes": ["Jungle", ""], "story": "Adventurer riding a dragon lizard.", "skills": [{"name": "Big Guy", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9d790cd46d08ab21d5cd0157a0c035c9.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Detona gains a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Big Guy</span> for 12s each time it or Barats damages an enemy with their skills (up to 10 stacks). Each stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Big Guy</span> increases Detona's size and grants 4-10 extra Hybrid Defense (scales with the level of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Detona's Welcome</span>). At max stacks, Detona gains 20% extra Resilience, and its Basic Attacks are replaced with <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Trample</span>, which deals <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+140% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#26e407\">(+3.5% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in a circular area, slows them by 40% for 0.2s, and refreshes the duration of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Big Guy</span> with each hit."}, {"name": "So-Called Teamwork", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d9d1ea11338786e2de0b748f9a796759.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7   Mana Cost: 25", "desc": "Detona spits contaminated oil in the target direction, dealing 60<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+7% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in a fan-shaped area. Barats then ignites the oil with a firecracker, dealing 120<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+180% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in the area (only 50% damage to Creeps).\n\nThe area of effect of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">So-Called Teamwork</span> increases with the number of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Big Guy</span> stacks."}, {"name": "Missile \"Expert\"", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_df6e9b7c26bd4b99dec7b1e187dd9608.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 11   Mana Cost: 70", "desc": "Barats fires two missiles at the target location, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+75% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and slowing enemies by 40% for 1s. The missiles expel fumes from their exhausts upon landing, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+75% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in a rectangular area and pushing them toward Barats."}, {"name": "Detona's Welcome", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2dcd8888aaa6d28df61cd49eb89085b5.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 50   Mana Cost: 100", "desc": "After a short delay, Detona charges in the target direction, dealing 120<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+70% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#26e407\">(+1.2% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to the first enemy hit, devouring and suppressing them for 1.2s, then spitting them out. If the spat‑out target hits an enemy hero or a wall, it triggers an explosion. The target and nearby enemies take an additional 180<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+105% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#26e407\">(+5% Total HP)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and are stunned for 1s.\n\nDuring the skill, Barats becomes immune to control effects. If the cast is canceled or the skill misses, 50% of the skill cooldown is refunded.\nIf Detona successfully devours an enemy, he immediately gains max stacks of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Big Guy</span>."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Tough Boots - Dire Hit", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6e5971b429e55f59cf100d8920cd7c32.png"}, {"name": "War Axe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_60_2/100_fa1f5745cf88227722a9ff22c95c0bc4.png"}, {"name": "Guardian Helmet", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fc3154808d5848c4b3d28ea921ee58b9.png"}, {"name": "Chastise Pauldron", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_2_1_18_2/100_b8ee29e065b82634a0453f1178b3c06f.png"}, {"name": "Radiant Armor", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2235566ea07c98eeece80a2cb56c296f.png"}, {"name": "Immortality", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_cc8a7730e6d539ac10d2e0ed91bf2785.png"}], "emblem": {"name": "Tank", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_9854de7cfbb30c9fb0002521a274be4c.png"}, "talents": [{"name": "Agility", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_3bd6911932aacab006e9ab2d7fd452bc.png", "tier": 1}, {"name": "Seasoned Hunter", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fe6ad272b01110393d55b4326164a3fa.png", "tier": 2}, {"name": "Concussive Blast", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8aecfaa8ede10da59863f6f55aee5ded.png", "tier": 3}], "spell": {"name": "Retribution", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2cd084a2661c121c347facb060a80377.png"}}, {"items": [{"name": "Flame Hunter's Tou